OL,3,GNEWSATwo police officers among seven
OL,4,Akilled in wrong-way car crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo police officers were among seven
OL,7,Fpeople killed when a car travelling the
OL,8,Fwrong way down a dual carriageway
OL,9,Fcrashed into a force vehicle.
OL,11,FA Volkswagen Passat with five occupants
OL,12,Fsaid to be in their late teens struck
OL,13,Fan oncoming marked Cleveland Police
OL,14,Fvehicle on the A66 near Middlesbrough
OL,15,Fat about 03:39 BST.
OL,17,FThe BBC understands a pursuit of the
OL,18,Fcar had ended before the crash, with
OL,19,Fthe police vehicle just happening to be
OL,20,Fin the South Bank area. The occupants
OL,21,Fof both cars were pronounced dead at
OL,22,Fthe scene.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
