OL,3,GNEWSATwo police officers among seven
OL,4,Akilled in wrong-way car crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe officers have been named as PC
OL,7,FMatthew Blades, 37, and PC Tom Clough,
OL,8,F38. Chief Constable Victoria Fuller
OL,9,Fsaid they were "brave officers
OL,10,Fprotecting our communities".
